       cessful call to ppoossiixx__ffaallllooccaattee(), subsequent writes to bytes in the
       specified range are guaranteed not to fail because of lack of disk
       space.

       If the size of the file is less than _o_f_f_s_e_t+_s_i_z_e, then the file is in‐
       creased to this size; otherwise the file size is left unchanged.

